{"4518270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mad Ever After", "steam_appid": 4518270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5132720], "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/eea6ffd851e80d24371869640747ce4b.poster.avif?t=1788343508\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/eea6ffd851e80d24371869640747ce4b.webm?t=1788343508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/eea6ffd851e80d24371869640747ce4b.mp4?t=1788343508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Happily Ever After? Not Anymore! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in 1-4 player co-op and fight your way through a fairytale world gone completely mad. Wield powerful shapeshifting magical staffs, battle hordes of bizarre creatures and face twisted versions of familiar fairytale characters as you try to survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/2b05e8ec3fe6adb14e6548c922e361bb.poster.avif?t=1788343508\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/2b05e8ec3fe6adb14e6548c922e361bb.webm?t=1788343508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/2b05e8ec3fe6adb14e6548c922e361bb.mp4?t=1788343508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control the Cube, Unleash Your Magic </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic in Mad Ever After isn't cast with the press of a button. Control your magical cube in the heat of battle to unleash powerful spells while fighting off the chaos around you. Combine different upgrades, discover powerful synergies and master the cube to turn every run into a unique magical arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/c03afd5e777eb008992bd41623f7fe14.poster.avif?t=1788343508\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/c03afd5e777eb008992bd41623f7fe14.webm?t=1788343508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/c03afd5e777eb008992bd41623f7fe14.mp4?t=1788343508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape Your Staff, Build Your Magic </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover legendary magical weapons that can turn the tide of battle. Wield a venomous Excalibur, breathe fire through a dragon-headed staff, freeze your enemies with the Ice Age Revolver or unleash chaos with a magical trombone. Combine them with your spells and upgrades to create unexpected synergies and a different magical arsenal every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/fa6d2b5af7a195b944a0a678111aa9c3.poster.avif?t=1788343508\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/fa6d2b5af7a195b944a0a678111aa9c3.webm?t=1788343508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/fa6d2b5af7a195b944a0a678111aa9c3.mp4?t=1788343508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fairytales, But Not As You Remember Them </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through corrupted realms where familiar stories have taken a very wrong turn. Help some tales find their way back on track, like returning the Bremen Musicians to the stage. Others may be beyond saving, leaving you to face a once-beloved princess transformed into a towering monster by an irreversible apple curse. Fight through the madness and discover which stories can still be saved and which must come to an end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/3e88728aa7a0e4029956223ce767fc00.poster.avif?t=1788343508\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/3e88728aa7a0e4029956223ce767fc00.webm?t=1788343508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/3e88728aa7a0e4029956223ce767fc00.mp4?t=1788343508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/eea6ffd851e80d24371869640747ce4b.poster.avif?t=1788343508\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/eea6ffd851e80d24371869640747ce4b.webm?t=1788343508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4518270/extras/eea6ffd851e80d243718696